Mark Steinberger <mark@CSC.ALBANY.EDU> wrote:
>Is there an adequate reason to move away from TeX? If not, then
>authoring tools should be TeX-based.

  I think the answer to this question is that if there emerges something
that people find better, they will switch to that. The ideal would probably
be switching to something that is in some sense upwards compatible with
TeX.

  Hans Aberg

